---
import { ArrowUp, Heart, ExternalLink } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      
      <!-- Brand & Mission Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <a href="#inici" class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img
            src="/assets/img/logo.svg"
            alt="balears.tech logo"
            width="36"
            height="36"
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl"
          />
          <span class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
            balears<span class="text-teal-400">.tech</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
          Iniciativa cívica i independent per apropar la tecnologia d'alt nivell, les dades obertes i el voluntariat digital a la societat i al teixit de les Illes Balears.
        </p>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 pt-2 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>Fet amb compromís cívic des de Mallorca per a les Balears</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Nav Links -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Iniciativa</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="#inici" class="hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">Manifest Cívic</a></li>
          <li><a href="#eixos" class="hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">Pilars de Suport</a></li>
          <li><a href="#projectes" class="hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">Projectes Actius</a></li>
          <li><a href="#perfil" class="hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">Trajectòria de Gabriel</a></li>
          <li><a href="#consultoria" class="hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">Consultoria Empresarial</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Ecosystem Subdomains Links -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Ecosistema</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://escoltes.balears.tech"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors"
            >
              <span>escoltes.balears.tech</span>
              <ExternalLink class="w-3 h-3" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://jisho.balears.tech"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors"
            >
              <span>jisho.balears.tech</span>
              <ExternalLink class="w-3 h-3" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://data-partner.xyz/ca/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors"
            >
              <span>data-partner.xyz</span>
              <ExternalLink class="w-3 h-3" />
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact & Social -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Connecta</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://calendar.app.google/YbQTidmXT3Bg9wdY8"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors"
            >
              Google Calendar (Cita prèvia)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://t.me/gabriel_rullan"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors"
            >
              Telegram @gabriel_rullan
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gabriel-rullan/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors"
            >
              LinkedIn
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="mailto:gabriel@data-partner.xyz"
              class="hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors"
            >
              gabriel@data-partner.xyz
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Line & Copyright -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
      <p>
        © 2026 balears.tech · Desenvolupat des de Mallorca per a les Illes Balears. Distribuït sota llicència oberta.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="#top"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors"
          aria-label="Torna a dalt de la pàgina"
        >
          <span>Torna a dalt</span>
          <ArrowUp class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
